<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 27px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #48b985; font-size: 25px; line-height: 27px;">25th November 2025 | 10am - 4pm</span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #48b985; font-size: 25px; line-height: 27px;"> Birmingham</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Hi!</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">It's only three weeks until Flywire’s <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-insights-summit-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>International Insights Summit</u></strong></span></a>; we hope you are looking forward to attending as much as we are looking forward to seeing you. By attending this <strong>free, CPD-certified</strong> event you will:<br />‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Hear invaluable perspectives and intelligence you can leverage to drive strategic decision-making, mitigate risk and give a competitive edge</li> 
<li>Take advantage of the unique opportunity to network with peers in the HE sector and hear their experiences, success stories and learning points</li> 
<li>Uncover how working closely with colleagues across Admissions, Finance and International Office to improve processes can deliver financial stability and improve conversion</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">As one attendee said, it is an "<em>excellent blend of expert speakers who delivered insightful context in a clear and engaging manner.</em>"</p> </td> 
</tr> 
