<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 27px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 25px; line-height: 27px; color: #48b985;">Agenda Highlights</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 26px; color: #147bd1;"><strong>Fireside Chat - The Bottom Line: Securing the Future of Higher Ed</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">With over two decade of combined experience, UK HE stalwarts, <strong>Jamie Warner, Head of Financial Operations at Goldsmiths, University of London</strong>, <strong>Peter Vermeulen, Chief Financial Officer, University of Bristol</strong> &amp; <strong>Christopher McDermott, Assistant Director of Finance, University of Greenwich</strong> will be sitting down to discuss how institutions can improve operations to to mitigate the challenges facing by the UK HE sector.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
