<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Flywire’s Oliver Mussett</strong> will unveil the findings from Flywire’s latest <strong>Admissions Navigator</strong> research. He will reveal what the research shows about the state of the UK HE sector when it comes to being ready to meet the future of international admissions and reveal some steps universities can take to improve their readiness and secure their future.</span></p> </td> 
